    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McKenna Healy are delighted to present No. 15, a beautifully maintained three-bedroom family home ideally positioned within the ever-popular Kelly's Bay development.\n\nThis inviting property offers bright, generously proportioned accommodation designed with modern family living in mind. At the heart of the home is an impressive living room, with double doors opening into the separate dining room. Patio doors provide a seamless connection to the rear garden, creating a wonderful setting for everyday family life and entertaining.\n\nThe well-appointed accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, living room, kitchen, dining room, utility room and guest WC. Upstairs are three spacious bedrooms, including a main bedroom with en-suite, together with a family bathroom.\n\nOutside, the property enjoys a private west-facing rear garden, ideal for making the most of the afternoon and evening sunshine. To the front, No. 15 benefits from an attractive and private outlook overlooking a large open green.\n\nKelly's Bay is a highly regarded residential development within walking distance of Skerries town centre and its excellent selection of amenities, including beaches, schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, bars and the train station.\n\nSkerries is a thriving seaside town renowned for its sandy beaches, scenic coastal walks and strong sense of community. An excellent range of sporting facilities is available locally, with golf, sailing, rugby, GAA, soccer and tennis clubs all close at hand. Dublin Airport and the M1 motorway are approximately 12 miles away, providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> End of Terrace</li><li> Side Entrance</li><li> Private West Facing Rear Garden</li><li> Guest WC</li><li> Main Bedroom En-suite</li><li> Over Looking Open Green</li><li> G.F.C.H.</li><li> Double Glazed Windows Throughout</ul>"
      },
